      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LINDENOW BUFFY (4) missed the frame last time when fifth (30.07) at this track but prior to that had two placings in a row. Goes very well at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Worth another chance. TRACKING YOU (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (26.73) last time in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win at Warragul. Should be thereabouts. DARK MIRACLE (6) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (34.85) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including two wins. The form out of last run is most impressive. Key runner on best form. WHY MUMMY (1) cannot be ruled out.",
